			<Text>Your unit discovers vast stores of ancient provisions, sending [ICON_FOOD] Food to your capital — but overindulging leaves them weakened.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Delete Tag="TXT_KEY_LEKMOD_CHOOSE_GOODY_FOOD"/>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_LEKMOD_CHOOSE_GOODY_FOOD">
			<Text>Feast on the ancient food stores (weakens the unit).</Text>
		</Row>

		<!-- Glutton promotion -->
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_GLUTTON">
			<Text>Glutton</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_GLUTTON_HELP">
			<Text>This unit overindulged on ancient provisions. -10% [ICON_STRENGTH] Combat Strength. Lost on upgrade.</Text>
		</Row>

